          <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden class="text-ink-300">·</span><span>Retrieval, authority, permissions, and bundle composition are treated as separate governed decisions.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden class="text-ink-300">·</span><span>Supervisor-planned subqueries and scoped bundles replace one-pass context gathering.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden class="text-ink-300">·</span><span>Best suited for workflows where correctness depends on structure, sequencing, and human-owned escalation.</span></li>
