          <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden class="text-accent">·</span><span>Authority tiers and permissions preserved before the agent sees anything.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden class="text-accent">·</span><span>Supervisor-planned subqueries and bundle assembly replace one-pass search.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden class="text-accent">·</span><span>Escalations surface missing or conflicting evidence instead of hiding it.</span></li>
        </ul>
