                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                >
                  <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-serif text-base leading-snug text-ink-900">{item.label}</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs italic leading-relaxed text-ink-400">{item.owner}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-24">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3 text-accent">What this agentic workflow does</p>
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-900">
        One vendor. One pipeline. Five acts.
      </h3>

      <div class="mt-6">
        <ActCard
          act="I"
          step={0}
          title="Nothing starts without the questionnaire"
          lede="Until OptiChain submits a complete vendor questionnaire, no review can begin. The pipeline halts, flags the gap, and asks Procurement to chase the submission."
          citation="R-01 · Vendor questionnaire intake"
        />

        <ActCard
          act="II"
          step={1}
          title="The workflow must classify the path early"
          lede="The system first determines whether the request belongs on a regulated or streamlined path. If the vendor touches ERP-connected, sensitive, or regulated data, the workflow moves into a stricter review posture before anything else continues."
          citation="R-02 · Onboarding path classification"
        />

        <ActCard
          act="III"
          step={2}
          title="Legal and compliance triggers must be made explicit"
          lede="Once the path is known, the workflow identifies what legal or compliance obligations are actually in play. That includes questions like whether a DPA is required and whether contractual review must block progress before implementation can move forward."
          citation="R-03 · Legal and compliance trigger determination"
        />

        <ActCard
          act="IV"
          step={3}
          title="Fast-track is earned, not assumed"
          lede="The system then determines whether the vendor can move through an expedited approval path or must stay on the standard route. If the request involves regulated data or even borderline risk, the workflow defaults to the standard path and records why."
          citation="R-04 · Fast-track eligibility"
        />

        <ActCard
          act="V"
          step={4}
          title="The output must become a real approval checklist"
          lede="The workflow does not stop at an assessment. It must produce a structured checklist showing every required sign-off, the responsible stakeholder, blockers that remain open, and the expected timeline before implementation can begin."
          citation="R-05 · Complete approval checklist generation"
        />

        <ActCard
          act="VI"
          step={5}
          title="Stakeholders need next-step guidance, not just analysis"
          lede="The final handoff must tell each team what they own, why their review is required, and what must happen next. The goal is to return something people can act on immediately, without forcing the business owner to interpret policies and approval rules on their own."
          citation="R-06 · Stakeholder guidance and handoff support"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="eyebrow mb-3 mt-24 text-accent">
      The document stack for our mock business scenario
    </p>
    <ol class="relative mt-8 space-y-10 before:absolute before:bottom-6 before:left-[1.125rem] before:top-6 before:w-px before:bg-accent/40 md:before:left-[1.375rem]">
      {
        documentStack.map((stage, i) => (
          <li class="relative grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,26rem)_minmax(0,1fr)] items-center gap-5 md:gap-7">
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-accent bg-paper font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-accent shadow-soft md:h-12 md:w-12 md:text-sm">
                {stage.label}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-100 bg-paper p-5 shadow-soft md:p-6">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900">
                  {stage.name}
                </h4>
                {stage.subtitle && (
                  <p class="text-xs italic text-ink-500">{stage.subtitle}</p>
                )}
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
                {stage.jurisdiction}
              </p>
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t border-ink-100 pt-4">
                {stage.documents.map((doc) => (
                  <DocumentViewer
                    client:visible
                    src={doc.src}
                    title={doc.title}
                    label={doc.label}
                    kind={doc.kind}
                  />
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="relative hidden self-stretch md:block">
              {i !== documentStack.length - 1 && (
                <svg
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  class="pointer-events-none absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-[calc(100%+5rem)] w-[240px] text-accent"
                  viewBox="0 0 240 260"
                  preserveAspectRatio="xMinYMin meet"
                >
                  <defs>
                    <path
                      id={`informs-path-${i}`}
                      d="M 10 24 C 120 10 198 60 200 132 C 202 204 112 248 18 234"
                    />
                    <marker
                      id={`informs-arrow-tip-${i}`}
                      viewBox="0 0 12 12"
                      refX="10"
                      refY="6"
                      markerWidth="9"
                      markerHeight="9"
                      orient="auto"
                    >
                      <path
                        d="M 1.5 1.5 L 10.5 6 L 1.5 10.5"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="1.4"
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                      />
                    </marker>
                  </defs>

                  <circle cx="10" cy="24" r="6.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.7" opacity="0.35" />
                  <circle cx="10" cy="24" r="2.4" fill="currentColor" />

                  <use
                    href={`#informs-path-${i}`}
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="0.7"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-dasharray="1 5"
                    opacity="0.45"
                    transform="translate(3 4)"
                  />

                  <use
                    href={`#informs-path-${i}`}
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="1.5"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    marker-end={`url(#informs-arrow-tip-${i})`}
                  />

                  <text
                    x="186"
                    y="138"
                    transform="rotate(-6 186 138)"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    text-anchor="end"
                    class="font-serif italic"
                    style="font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.06em;"
                  >
                    informs
                  </text>
                </svg>
              )}
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>

    <p class="eyebrow mb-3 mt-24 text-accent">Domain agents in the pipeline</p>
    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-5">
      {
        domainAgents.map((agent) => (
          <article class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-ink-100 bg-paper p-6 shadow-soft">
            <AgentIcon kind={agent.icon} class="h-10 w-10 text-accent" />
            <h4 class="mt-5 font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">{agent.title}</h4>
            <p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">{agent.body}</p>
            <div class="mt-5 border-t border-ink-100 pt-4">
              <DocumentViewer
                client:visible
                src={agent.document.src}
                title={agent.document.title}
                label={agent.document.label}
                kind={agent.document.kind}
              />
            </div>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
      <a
        href="/demo"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink-900 px-5 py-3 font-medium text-paper no-underline shadow-soft transition-colors hover:bg-ink-800"
      >
        See the demo replay
        <span aria-hidden>→</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/findings"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-200 bg-paper px-5 py-3 font-medium text-ink-800 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-ink-900"
      >
        Review the findings
      </a>
    </div>
  </NarrativeSection>
</BaseLayout>

